    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwisagījiwa Nsugi ntūngīlīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balī mu kwihīga a badīīmi abo bakajikenaagūlaga na kūjisalang'hanya ī ng'holo jane!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'holo jane:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ījo nakajidīīmaga nene.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, alībawīla a badīīmi abo bakajidīīmaga ī ng'holo jakwe; alīhaya, “A bing'we īkī ng'walīsambaaja ī lidaale lya ng'holo jane ng'ūjitaja, hama ndūhū nūūlū kūjidīlīla, nakūng'winha nsango kūlwa nguno ya būbi wing'we ūbo ng'wawīta.” Alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nakūjibilinga nene ng'wenekīlī ī ng'holo j'idaale lyane ījo jasaagīīla mu mapandī ga mu sī jose ūko naajisambaagīja. Hanuma nakūjishosha kwidīīmīlo lyajo, jandye hangī kwibyala jikwīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūjitūūlīla badīīmi ba kūjilang'hana chiza, joye ū kwikala jogohaga nūūlū kwibakīla bakīla; hama ītūgaya ho nūūlū īmò yaajo.” Alīhaya SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Jikūshika shikū, a banhū bakooya ū kūhaya gīkī, ‘Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga ūyo akabenha Baisilaeli kūfuma mu sī ya Misili,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bakūyūhaya, ‘Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga ūyo akawenha būbyīle wa Baisilaeli kūfuma kū sī ya sukuma, na kūfuma kū sī jose ūko walī wabaponya!’ Hūna bakwikala mu sī yabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bahangi balomolomo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mihayo ya bahangi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya, “A bahangi na a bagabīji batī na logohano ū kūlī Mulungu; nū mu numba yane naabūbonile ū būsoso wabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ī nzīla jabo jikūbiza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakīyigwaga ī mihayo īyo bakīyombaga a bahangi abo bakahangaga būlomolomo mu lina lyane bakūhayaga, “Naalootaga shilooti! Naalootaga shilooti! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya bahangi abo bakahangaga būlomolomo bo kūfuma mu ng'holò jabo benaba, īkwikala īkūjaga gīko ū mu ng'holò jabo kūshisha nanalī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bene bakiganikaga gīkī ū mu kūmanilotoolela shilooti shabo boi kū boi, bakūbīīta a banhū bane balyībe ī lina lyane, gīt'ūmo bakūlūgenji babo baalī baalyībīla ī lina lyane; būyūlamya Mabaalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hangi ūyo alī na shilooti, n'ashilotoolage ī shilooti shakwe; alīyo ūyo alī na mhayo gwane, n'agūhayage mu ng'hana. Ī gīsī a meela gakūlenganīla ginehe nī mbeke.” Alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Ū mhayo gwane gūtabizile gītī moto, nūūlū gītī nundo īyo īkapaanagūlaga nūūlū iwe lyatandagūka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nalī na wilwisha nabo a bahangi abo bakiyibīlaga mihayo īyo bakiganikaga gīkī īlī yane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, “Na ng'hana nalī na wilwisha nabo a bahangi abo bakahoyookaga mihayo na ndīmi jabo benekīlī, alīyo ū kūnū būhaya gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA hū ng'wene alīhaya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alichene, nalī na wilwisha nabo abo bakahangaga bo shilooti sha nyalomolomo.” Alīhaya SEEBA. “Īsho bakashihooyelaga hūna bayūbahūbya a banhū bane bakūtūmamīlaga būhwahwa wabo būtī mu nzīla; alīyo ū nene natabatūmile, nūūlū kūbalagīla. Batī na gwa kūpya gete ū gwa kūbinha a banhū benaba.” Alīhaya SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mhayo gwa bahangi balomolomo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benaba, nūūlū abize ng'hangi nūūlū ngabīji, ūlū būkūbūūja gīkī, Gūlīho mhayo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mhayo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, nigo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kī ū go ng'wa SEEBA ī haha? Ū bebe ūkūbashokeja, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, A bing'we mulīkooba mhayo kī? Nakūmuponya kūle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūlū ng'hangibo se ose nūūlū ngabīji, nūūlū munhū ūngī ūhaya gīkī, “Ūyū gwene mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA!” Ū munhū ng'wenūyo nakūng'winha nsango hamò nī kaya yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bing'we mutogilwe kūmanibūūgīlīja, būlī ng'wene na nwani ng'wiye nūūlū ndūgūye; gīkī, “Ū SEEBA alī n'ishosho kī?” Nūūlū gīkī, “Alīhaya ginehe ū SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo oyagi gete ū kwikala ng'ūhaya, “Mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA.” Nguno būlī munhū akūhayaga mhayo gwakwe, alīyo angū gwabiza gīkī gwafumaga kūlī SEEBA. Ū mu gīko mukwīhūbyaga ī mihayo ya ng'wa Mulungu mpanga, ū SEEBA wa mabità, ū Mulungu wise! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'hangi mutogilwe kūmūūgīlīja mulīhaya, “Ū SEEBA wakūshokegije mhayo kī?” Nūūlū gīkī, “Bebe ū SEEBA wahayile mhayo kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we ī chene mutogilwe kūhaya, “Ūyū gwene mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA, alīyo ū SEEBA alīhaya, Ī mihayo yenīyī; ī gīkī, ‘Ūyū gwene mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA,’ naamulemeja ū kwīhaya, nūūlū īkī mukikalaga ng'ūhaya gīkī, ‘Ūyū gwene mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA.’” ",
